{"id":"mahabharata-6-096","work":"mahabharata","part":6,"partName":"भीष्मपर्व","partNameEn":"Bhishma Parva","unit":96,"title":"षण्णवतितमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 96 · Ninth day: Abhimanyu and the demon Alambusha","summary":{"en":"Abhimanyu storms the Kaurava army like a lion, and the Kauravas cannot stop him. He and the rakshasa Alambusha come together in a duel like Indra against Shambara.","kn":"ಅಭಿಮನ್ಯು ಸಿಂಹದಂತೆ ಕೌರವ ಸೈನ್ಯದ ಮೇಲೆ ನುಗ್ಗುತ್ತಾನೆ; ಕೌರವರಿಗೆ ತಡೆಯಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ. ಅವನೂ ರಾಕ್ಷಸ ಅಲಂಬುಷನೂ ಇಂದ್ರ-ಶಂಬರರಂತೆ ದ್ವಂದ್ವಯುದ್ಧ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ.","hi":"अभिमन्यु सिंह की तरह कौरव सेना में घुसता है और कौरव उसे रोक नहीं पाते। उसका और राक्षस अलम्बुष का इन्द्र और शम्बर जैसा द्वन्द्व होता है।","te":"అభిమన్యుడు సింహంలా కౌరవసేనలోకి దూకుతాడు; కౌరవులు ఆపలేరు. అతనికి, రాక్షసుడు అలంబుషునికి ఇంద్ర శంబరులలా ద్వంద్వ యుద్ధం జరుగుతుంది.","ta":"அபிமன்யு சிங்கம் போல் கௌரவப் படையுள் புக, கௌரவர் தடுக்க முடியவில்லை. அவனுக்கும் அரக்கன் அலம்புசனுக்கும் இந்திரன் சம்பரன் போன்ற தனிப்போர் நடக்கிறது.","ml":"അഭിമന്യു സിംഹത്തെപ്പോലെ കൗരവ സൈന്യത്തിലേക്ക് ഇരച്ചുകയറുന്നു; അദ്ദേഹത്തെ തടയാൻ കൗരവർക്കാകുന്നില്ല. ശംബരനെതിരെ ഇന്ദ്രൻ എന്നപോലെ അദ്ദേഹം രാക്ഷസനായ അലംബുഷനുമായി ദ്വന്ദ്വയുദ്ധത്തിൽ ഏർപ്പെടുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 6.96; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Jul 26 2021","sections":[{"title":"भीष्मवधपर्व","titleEn":"Bhishmavadha Parva (The fall of Bhishma)","verses":[{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"अभिमन्यू रथोदारः पिशङ्गैस्तुरगोत्तमैः ।\nअभिदुद्राव तेजस्वी दुर्योधनबलं महत् ।\nविकिरञ्शरवर्षाणि वारिधारा इवाम्बुदः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Abhimanyu, noble on his chariot and drawn by the finest tawny horses, radiant, rushed upon Duryodhana's great army, pouring showers of arrows as a cloud pours streams of water."}},{"n":2,"text":"न शेकुः समरे क्रुद्धं सौभद्रमरिसूदनम् ।\nशस्त्रौघिणं गाहमानं सेनासागरमक्षयम् ।\nनिवारयितुमप्याजौ त्वदीयाः कुरुपुंगवाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Your foremost Kurus could not stop the enraged Saubhadra, slayer of foes, as he plunged, a torrent of weapons, into that inexhaustible ocean of troops."}},{"n":3,"text":"तेन मुक्ता रणे राजञ्शराः शत्रुनिबर्हणाः ।\nक्षत्रियाननयञ्शूरान्प्रेतराजनिवेशनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The arrows he loosed in battle, O king, which destroyed his enemies, led brave Kshatriyas to the abode of the king of the dead."}},{"n":4,"text":"यमदण्डोपमान्घोराञ्ज्वलनाशीविषोपमान् ।\nसौभद्रः समरे क्रुद्धः प्रेषयामास सायकान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Enraged in the battle, Saubhadra sent forth terrible arrows, like Yama's rod, like blazing venomous snakes."}},{"n":5,"text":"रथिनं च रथात्तूर्णं हयपृष्ठाच्च सादिनम् ।\nगजारोहांश्च सगजान्पातयामास फाल्गुनिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Phalguni's son swiftly knocked down charioteers from their chariots, horsemen from their horses' backs, and elephant-riders together with their elephants."}},{"n":6,"text":"तस्य तत्कुर्वतः कर्म महत्संख्येऽद्भुतं नृपाः ।\nपूजयां चक्रिरे हृष्टाः प्रशशंसुश्च फाल्गुनिम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing that great and wondrous deed of his in battle, the kings, delighted, honoured and praised Phalguni's son."}},{"n":7,"text":"तान्यनीकानि सौभद्रो द्रावयन्बह्वशोभत ।\nतूलराशिमिवाधूय मारुतः सर्वतोदिशम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Scattering those divisions, Saubhadra shone brightly, like the wind blowing a heap of cotton in every direction."}},{"n":8,"text":"तेन विद्राव्यमाणानि तव सैन्यानि भारत ।\nत्रातारं नाध्यगच्छन्त पङ्के मग्ना इव द्विपाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Driven off by him, your armies, Bharata, found no protector, like elephants sunk in mud."}},{"n":9,"text":"विद्राव्य सर्वसैन्यानि तावकानि नरोत्तमः ।\nअभिमन्युः स्थितो राजन्विधूमोऽग्निरिव ज्वलन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having routed all your troops, that best of men, Abhimanyu, stood, O king, blazing like a smokeless fire."}},{"n":10,"text":"न चैनं तावकाः सर्वे विषेहुररिघातिनम् ।\nप्रदीप्तं पावकं यद्वत्पतंगाः कालचोदिताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"None of your men could withstand that slayer of foes, as moths, driven by fate, cannot withstand a blazing fire."}},{"n":11,"text":"प्रहरन्सर्वशत्रुभ्यः पाण्डवानां महारथः ।\nअदृश्यत महेष्वासः सवज्र इव वज्रभृत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Striking at all enemies, that great chariot-warrior of the Pandavas, the great archer, looked like the thunderbolt-bearer with his thunderbolt."}},{"n":12,"text":"हेमपृष्ठं धनुश्चास्य ददृशे चरतो दिशः ।\nतोयदेषु यथा राजन्भ्राजमानाः शतह्रदाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"As he ranged in every direction, his gold-backed bow was seen like flashes of lightning among clouds, O king."}},{"n":13,"text":"शराश्च निशिताः पीता निश्चरन्ति स्म संयुगे ।\nवनात्फुल्लद्रुमाद्राजन्भ्रमराणामिव व्रजाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Sharp yellow arrows flew out in the battle, O king, like swarms of bees from a forest of flowering trees."}},{"n":14,"text":"तथैव चरतस्तस्य सौभद्रस्य महात्मनः ।\nरथेन मेघघोषेण ददृशुर्नान्तरं जनाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"As that great-souled Saubhadra moved about thus in his chariot, which rumbled like a cloud, people could not see any gap in his motion."}},{"n":15,"text":"मोहयित्वा कृपं द्रोणं द्रौणिं च स बृहद्बलम् ।\nसैन्धवं च महेष्वासं व्यचरल्लघु सुष्ठु च ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having bewildered Kripa, Drona, Drona's son, mighty Brihadbala, and the great archer king of Sindhu, he moved about swiftly and with skill."}},{"n":16,"text":"मण्डलीकृतमेवास्य धनुः पश्याम मारिष ।\nसूर्यमण्डलसंकाशं तपतस्तव वाहिनीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"We saw his bow drawn into a perfect circle, my lord, like the disc of the sun scorching your army."}},{"n":17,"text":"तं दृष्ट्वा क्षत्रियाः शूराः प्रतपन्तं शरार्चिभिः ।\nद्विफल्गुनमिमं लोकं मेनिरे तस्य कर्मभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing him blaze with the flames of his arrows, the brave Kshatriyas, by his deeds, took this world to have two Phalgunas (Arjunas)."}},{"n":18,"text":"तेनार्दिता महाराज भारती सा महाचमूः ।\nबभ्राम तत्र तत्रैव योषिन्मदवशादिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tormented by him, great king, that great army of the Bharatas reeled hither and thither like a woman drunk with passion."}},{"n":19,"text":"द्रावयित्वा च तत्सैन्यं कम्पयित्वा महारथान् ।\nनन्दयामास सुहृदो मयं जित्वेव वासवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having routed that army and shaken its great chariot-fighters, he gladdened his friends as Vasava did after conquering Maya."}},{"n":20,"text":"तेन विद्राव्यमाणानि तव सैन्यानि संयुगे ।\nचक्रुरार्तस्वरं घोरं पर्जन्यनिनदोपमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Routed by him in the battle, your armies raised a terrible cry of distress, like the roar of thunder."}},{"n":21,"text":"तं श्रुत्वा निनदं घोरं तव सैन्यस्य मारिष ।\nमारुतोद्धूतवेगस्य समुद्रस्येव पर्वणि ।\nदुर्योधनस्तदा राजा आर्श्यशृङ्गिमभाषत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing that fearful din of your army, which surged like the sea on a full-moon day driven by the wind, King Duryodhana spoke to Alambusha, son of Rishyashringa."}},{"n":22,"text":"एष कार्ष्णिर्महेष्वासो द्वितीय इव फल्गुनः ।\nचमूं द्रावयते क्रोधाद्वृत्रो देवचमूमिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"This great archer, the son of Krishna's sister, like a second Phalguna, is routing our army in fury, as Vritra routed the army of the gods."}},{"n":23,"text":"तस्य नान्यं प्रपश्यामि संयुगे भेषजं महत् ।\nऋते त्वां राक्षसश्रेष्ठ सर्वविद्यासु पारगम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I see no other great remedy for him in the battle but you, best of rakshasas, who have mastered every art."}},{"n":24,"text":"स गत्वा त्वरितं वीरं जहि सौभद्रमाहवे ।\nवयं पार्थान्हनिष्यामो भीष्मद्रोणपुरःसराः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Go quickly and kill that hero Saubhadra in the fight. We, led by Bhishma and Drona, will kill the Parthas.\""}},{"n":25,"text":"स एवमुक्तो बलवान्राक्षसेन्द्रः प्रतापवान् ।\nप्रययौ समरे तूर्णं तव पुत्रस्य शासनात् ।\nनर्दमानो महानादं प्रावृषीव बलाहकः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus addressed, the mighty and glorious king of the rakshasas set out swiftly to the battle at the command of your son, roaring a great roar like a cloud in the rains."}},{"n":26,"text":"तस्य शब्देन महता पाण्डवानां महद्बलम् ।\nप्राचलत्सर्वतो राजन्पूर्यमाण इवार्णवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"At his great cry the great army of the Pandavas stirred on every side, O king, like the swelling sea."}},{"n":27,"text":"बहवश्च नरा राजंस्तस्य नादेन भीषिताः ।\nप्रियान्प्राणान्परित्यज्य निपेतुर्धरणीतले ॥","meaning":{"en":"Many men, terrified by his roar, gave up their dear lives and fell on the ground, O king."}},{"n":28,"text":"कार्ष्णिश्चापि मुदा युक्तः प्रगृहीतशरासनः ।\nनृत्यन्निव रथोपस्थे तद्रक्षः समुपाद्रवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"And Krishna's nephew, glad, bow in hand, ran at that rakshasa as if dancing on his chariot-seat."}},{"n":29,"text":"ततः स राक्षसः क्रुद्धः संप्राप्यैवार्जुनिं रणे ।\nनातिदूरे स्थितस्तस्य द्रावयामास वै चमूम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the angry rakshasa, having reached Arjuna's son in the battle, stood not far from him and began routing his army."}},{"n":30,"text":"सा वध्यमाना समरे पाण्डवानां महाचमूः ।\nप्रत्युद्ययौ रणे रक्षो देवसेना यथा बलिम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Struck in the battle, that great Pandava army went forth against the rakshasa, as the army of the gods against Bali."}},{"n":31,"text":"विमर्दः सुमहानासीत्तस्य सैन्यस्य मारिष ।\nरक्षसा घोररूपेण वध्यमानस्य संयुगे ॥","meaning":{"en":"A great turmoil arose in that army as it was being slain in the fight by the dreadful rakshasa."}},{"n":32,"text":"ततः शरसहस्रैस्तां पाण्डवानां महाचमूम् ।\nव्यद्रावयद्रणे रक्षो दर्शयद्वै पराक्रमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the rakshasa, showing his prowess, scattered that great Pandava army in the battle with thousands of arrows."}},{"n":33,"text":"सा वध्यमाना च तथा पाण्डवानामनीकिनी ।\nरक्षसा घोररूपेण प्रदुद्राव रणे भयात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus slaughtered by the terrible rakshasa, the Pandava host fled from the battle in fear."}},{"n":34,"text":"तां प्रमृद्य ततः सेनां पद्मिनीं वारणो यथा ।\nततोऽभिदुद्राव रणे द्रौपदेयान्महाबलान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having trampled that army as an elephant tramples a lotus pond, he then rushed in the battle at the mighty sons of Draupadi."}},{"n":35,"text":"ते तु क्रुद्धा महेष्वासा द्रौपदेयाः प्रहारिणः ।\nराक्षसं दुद्रुवुः सर्वे ग्रहाः पञ्च यथा रविम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those angry great archers, the sons of Draupadi, striking hard, all ran at the rakshasa, like five planets at the sun."}},{"n":36,"text":"वीर्यवद्भिस्ततस्तैस्तु पीडितो राक्षसोत्तमः ।\nयथा युगक्षये घोरे चन्द्रमाः पञ्चभिर्ग्रहैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Pressed by those mighty ones, the best of rakshasas looked like the moon pressed by five planets at the dreadful end of an age."}},{"n":37,"text":"प्रतिविन्ध्यस्ततो रक्षो बिभेद निशितैः शरैः ।\nसर्वपारशवैस्तूर्णमकुण्ठाग्रैर्महाबलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then mighty Prativindhya pierced the rakshasa with sharp, unblunted iron arrows."}},{"n":38,"text":"स तैर्भिन्नतनुत्राणः शुशुभे राक्षसोत्तमः ।\nमरीचिभिरिवार्कस्य संस्यूतो जलदो महान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his armour cut by them, the best of rakshasas shone like a great cloud stitched through with the rays of the sun."}},{"n":39,"text":"विषक्तैः स शरैश्चापि तपनीयपरिच्छदैः ।\nआर्श्यशृङ्गिर्बभौ राजन्दीप्तशृङ्ग इवाचलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Studded with arrows adorned with gold, Alambusha, son of Rishyashringa, shone like a mountain with blazing peaks, O king."}},{"n":40,"text":"ततस्ते भ्रातरः पञ्च राक्षसेन्द्रं महाहवे ।\nविव्यधुर्निशितैर्बाणैस्तपनीयविभूषितैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the five brothers pierced the king of rakshasas in that great fight with sharp arrows decked with gold."}},{"n":41,"text":"स निर्भिन्नः शरैर्घोरैर्भुजगैः कोपितैरिव ।\nअलम्बुसो भृशं राजन्नागेन्द्र इव चुक्रुधे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Wounded by those fearful arrows, like enraged snakes, Alambusha raged greatly, O king, like a lord of elephants."}},{"n":42,"text":"सोऽतिविद्धो महाराज मुहूर्तमथ मारिष ।\nप्रविवेश तमो दीर्घं पीडितस्तैर्महारथैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Sorely hurt, great king, he for a moment fell into deep darkness, pressed hard by those great chariot-warriors."}},{"n":43,"text":"प्रतिलभ्य ततः संज्ञां क्रोधेन द्विगुणीकृतः ।\nचिच्छेद सायकैस्तेषां ध्वजांश्चैव धनूंषि च ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, regaining his senses and doubled in fury, he cut down their banners and bows with his arrows."}},{"n":44,"text":"एकैकं च त्रिभिर्बाणैराजघान स्मयन्निव ।\nअलम्बुसो रथोपस्थे नृत्यन्निव महारथः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Smiling, as it were, he struck each of them with three arrows, that great warrior Alambusha, who seemed to dance on his chariot-seat."}},{"n":45,"text":"त्वरमाणश्च संक्रुद्धो हयांस्तेषां महात्मनाम् ।\nजघान राक्षसः क्रुद्धः सारथींश्च महाबलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Quickly and in rage, the mighty, angry rakshasa killed the horses of those great-souled ones and their charioteers."}},{"n":46,"text":"बिभेद च सुसंहृष्टः पुनश्चैनान्सुसंशितैः ।\nशरैर्बहुविधाकारैः शतशोऽथ सहस्रशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Greatly delighted, he again pierced them with sharp arrows of many shapes, by hundreds and thousands."}},{"n":47,"text":"विरथांश्च महेष्वासान्कृत्वा तत्र स राक्षसः ।\nअभिदुद्राव वेगेन हन्तुकामो निशाचरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having made those great archers chariotless, that night-ranger rushed at them swiftly, wishing to kill them."}},{"n":48,"text":"तानर्दितान्रणे तेन राक्षसेन दुरात्मना ।\nदृष्ट्वार्जुनसुतः संख्ये राक्षसं समुपाद्रवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing them hard pressed in the battle by that wicked rakshasa, Arjuna's son attacked the rakshasa."}},{"n":49,"text":"तयोः समभवद्युद्धं वृत्रवासवयोरिव ।\nददृशुस्तावकाः सर्वे पाण्डवाश्च महारथाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"A fight then took place between them like that of Vritra and Vasava; all your men and the great chariot-fighters of the Pandavas watched."}},{"n":50,"text":"तौ समेतौ महायुद्धे क्रोधदीप्तौ परस्परम् ।\nमहाबलौ महाराज क्रोधसंरक्तलोचनौ ।\nपरस्परमवेक्षेतां कालानलसमौ युधि ॥","meaning":{"en":"Meeting in that great battle, the two mighty ones, blazing with anger at each other, their eyes red with rage, looked at each other like the fire of doom."}},{"n":51,"text":"तयोः समागमो घोरो बभूव कटुकोदयः ।\nयथा देवासुरे युद्धे शक्रशम्बरयोरिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"Their encounter was fearful and bitter in its outcome, like that between Indra and Shambara in the war of gods and demons."}}]}]}